{"sections":[{"slug":"EC-H1-H2","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"EC-H1-H2"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展上同调讨论班</span> : <span lang=\"zh\">非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">主齐性空间与</span> Brauer <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">讲义</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"平展上同调讨论班 : 非 Abel 上同调, 主齐性空间与 Brauer 群"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"讲义"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这是</span> 2025 <span lang=\"zh\">年秋季平展上同调讨论班的一篇讲稿</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">参考</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/MilneEC","text":"Milne"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">第一部分</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">主齐性空间与</span> $H^1$) <span lang=\"zh\">是第</span> III.4 <span lang=\"zh\">节</span>,</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">第二部分</span> (Brauer <span lang=\"zh\">群与</span> $H^2$) <span lang=\"zh\">是第</span> IV <span lang=\"zh\">章</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>TODO</h1>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">第一次讲之后留下的漏洞</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"/>\n<span lang=\"zh\">没能写出</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/非交换Čech上同调","text":"Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上圈</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯同伦","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯同伦</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对应的具体条件</span>. ("},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯同伦","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯同伦</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">页面写出了单纯同伦的前几个分量以及具体条件</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/非交换Čech上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">非交换</span> Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">页面写出了具体到</span> Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上圈的情形</span>.)</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n<span lang=\"zh\">没有说清具体的</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">景上</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/非交换Čech上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">非交换</span> Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">与真正的上同调的关系</span>.</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n<span lang=\"zh\">没证明</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">局部自由</span> $\\mathcal O_X$-<span lang=\"zh\">模到平坦局部自由</span> $\\mathcal O_X$-<span lang=\"zh\">模的拉回函子反映同构</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/MilneLEC","text":"Milne LEC"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span> 11.4 <span lang=\"zh\">证明中略去的部分</span>).</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n<span lang=\"zh\">有限群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Galois覆叠","text":"Galois <span lang=\"zh\">覆叠</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/平展基本群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展基本群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的关系</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h1><span lang=\"zh\">主齐性空间与一阶上同调</span></h1>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">本节的目标是</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">说明一般的</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/非Abel上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主齐性空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" (principal homogeneous space) <span lang=\"zh\">的关系</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">说明系数为</span> $\\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平展上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/向量丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">向量丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的关系</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">介绍</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kummer理论","text":"Kummer <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">一般理论</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">某种意义上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">上同调是比传统的</span> “Abel” <span lang=\"zh\">上同调更简单的概念</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">它的简单在于定义的简单</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而不简单在于没有什么计算的手段</span>.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">页面讨论了上同调的一般理论</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">数学上所有名为</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">某某上同调</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的概念</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">无论</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">或者非</span> Abel, <span lang=\"zh\">都是如下概念的特殊情况</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong> (<span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>). <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", $X,A$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">系数</span> $0$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">为映射空间的截断</span>\n$$\r\nH^0(X,A) := \\pi_0 \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">对于正整数</span> $n$, <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span> $X,A$, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}^n A$, <span lang=\"zh\">则定义</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">系数</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶上同调为</span>\n$$\r\nH^n(X,A) := H^0(X,\\mathbf{B}^n A) = \\pi_0\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\mathbf{B}^n A).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">由上述讨论</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">我们可定义群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">系数的</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶上同调</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有一阶</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}G$, <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span> $H^1(X,G)$ <span lang=\"zh\">就定义为</span>\n$$\r\nH^1(X,G) := \\pi_0\\operatorname{Hom}(X,\\mathbf{B}G).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一般地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">要计算空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">到空间</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的映射空间</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">若能将</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">表示为某类对象的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分类空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分类空间</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则要计算的东西可以转化为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的这类对象的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">丛</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}G$ <span lang=\"zh\">正是</span> $G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主齐性空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">群胚</span></strong> (<span lang=\"zh\">因为</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">任何</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主齐性空间都同构于</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">本身</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而这个对象的自同构群就是</span> $G$”), <span lang=\"zh\">所以毫不奇怪地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">计算</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">系数</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">上同调就是计算</span> $G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">平坦景上的主齐性空间</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">页面介绍的主丛的一般理论</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">现在我们将它具体到概形的平坦景上</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的平坦局部有限型群</span> $G$. <span lang=\"zh\">以下所有概形均为</span> $X$-<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在概形的平坦景上讨论</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">重要的一点是局部有限表现概形的范畴</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/米田嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">米田嵌入</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">到平坦景上的层范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这称为</span> Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">拓扑的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/次典范拓扑","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">次典范性</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">对概形的许多讨论都可以推广到平坦景上的层</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">局部平凡性</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">首先</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">我们看主丛的局部平凡性如何表现在平坦景上</span>. (<span lang=\"zh\">回忆抽象的主丛的局部平凡性不过是因为主丛平凡化自身</span>.)</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">作用于概形</span> $S$. <span lang=\"zh\">如下条件等价</span>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>$S$ <span lang=\"zh\">忠实平坦</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">局部有限型</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $S\\times_X G\\to S\\times_X S$ <span lang=\"zh\">为同构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中两个分量分别为作用映射和投影映射</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">存在平坦覆盖</span> $\\{U_i \\to X\\}$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $S_{U_i}$ <span lang=\"zh\">带有的</span> $G_{U_i}$-<span lang=\"zh\">作用等同于</span> $G_{U_i}$ <span lang=\"zh\">在自身上的作用</span>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 $\\Rightarrow$ 2. <span lang=\"zh\">取覆盖为</span> $S\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">即可</span>.</li>\n<li>2 $\\Rightarrow$ 1. <span lang=\"zh\">令</span> $U=\\bigsqcup_i U_i$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $U$ <span lang=\"zh\">忠实平坦</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">局部有限型</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $S_U$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $G_U$-<span lang=\"zh\">作用同构于</span> $G_U$. <span lang=\"zh\">这意味着</span>$$\r\n  (S\\times_X G)_U \\to (S\\times_X S)_U\r\n$$<span lang=\"zh\">为同构</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">沿</span> $U\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">使用下降理论</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可知</span>$$\r\n  S\\times_X G\\to S\\times_X S\r\n$$<span lang=\"zh\">亦为同构</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">可表性</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">平坦景上的层不一定可表为概形</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">但是对于平坦景上的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主齐性空间</span> $S$, <span lang=\"zh\">由于我们</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">已知</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">其被一个有限型忠实平坦映射拉回之后同构于</span> $G$, <span lang=\"zh\">故有较大的希望应用概形的</span> fpqc <span lang=\"zh\">下降</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/MilneEC","text":"Milne"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span> I.2.23) <span lang=\"zh\">证明</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">可表</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这件事在如下情形中成立</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/MilneEC","text":"Milne"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span> III.4.3):</p>\n<ol>\n<li>$G$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上仿射</span>;</li>\n<li>$G$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上光滑</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">分离</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的维数</span> $\\leq 1$;</li>\n<li>…</li>\n</ol>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">上圈</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一般而言</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">类的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数学对象的表现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">称为上圈</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于一阶非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">有一种重要的表现称为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/非交换Čech上同调","text":"Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上圈</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/非交换Čech上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">非交换</span> Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">页面介绍了</span> Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上圈的抽象陈述</span>, Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上同调与真正的上同调的关系</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">并讨论了</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断情形</span>.</p>\n<h2>Zariski, <span lang=\"zh\">平展与平坦的比较</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Zar-fl-et","text":"Zariski, <span lang=\"zh\">平展与平坦的比较</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">应用</span>: Kummer <span lang=\"zh\">理论与</span> Artin–Schreier <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kummer理论","text":"Kummer <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Artin–Schreier理论","text":"Artin–Schreier <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Brauer <span lang=\"zh\">群与二阶上同调</span></h1>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">本节介绍概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Brauer <span lang=\"zh\">群与</span> $H^2(X,\\mathbb G_m)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的关系</span>; $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Azumaya代数","text":"Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的相似等价类</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita等价","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">类</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">给出</span> $H^2(X,\\mathbb G_m)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">假设读者了解域</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Brauer <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/中心单代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">中心单代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的相似类关于张量积构成的群</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">局部环的</span> Brauer <span lang=\"zh\">群</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部环</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">相比于一个</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Azumaya代数","text":"Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">具体是什么</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">我们其实更加关心</span> Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">自同构群</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是什么</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">因为我们最后关心的是这种对象的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">丛的同构类</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">集合</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">而任何一个丛都关联于一个群的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">这个群正是纤维的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">自同构群</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">所以如下的命题是尤其重要的</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">但目前我不知道如何更好地理解这个命题</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/Skolem–Noether定理","text":"Skolem–Noether <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/MilneEC","text":"Milne"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">命题</span> IV.1.4). <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Azumaya代数","text":"Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数的自同构均为内自同构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即形如</span> $a\\mapsto uau^{-1}$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $u\\in A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为可逆元</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/MilneEC","text":"Milne"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">推论</span> IV.1.5). $M_n(R)$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数的自同构群是</span> $\\mathrm{PGL}_n(R) = \\mathrm{GL}_n(R) / R^*$.</p>\n<h2>Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数与概形的</span> Brauer <span lang=\"zh\">群</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Azumaya代数","text":"Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">页面介绍了</span> Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数的基本性质</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">概形上的</span> Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平展景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部矩阵代数</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">概形上的</span> Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数的自同构在</span> <strong>Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">局部</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">为内自同构</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/Skolem–Noether定理","text":"Skolem–Noether<span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>"}},{"Plain":").</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">概形上的</span> Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">同构类</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $H^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mathrm{PGL}_n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">分类</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">群同态</span> $\\mathrm{GL}_n \\to \\mathrm{PGL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/非Abel上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的映射</span> $H^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mathrm{GL}_n) \\to H^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mathrm{PGL}_n)$ (<span lang=\"zh\">向量丛</span> $\\to$ Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">将向量丛</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应到</span> $\\operatorname{End}(E)$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita等价","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">页面介绍了</span> Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价的等价刻画</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">由此可以证明</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Azumaya代数","text":"Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">相似</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">等同于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita等价","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">也即模范畴的等价</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">故</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">相似类</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">含于</span> $H^2(X,\\mathbb G_m)$, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可逆线性范畴层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可逆线性范畴层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的等价类</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">正合列</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对概形</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">有带基点集合的正合列</span>\n$$\r\n\\cdots\\to H^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mathrm{GL}_n) \\to H^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mathrm{PGL}_n) \\overset{d}{\\to} H^2(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mathbb G_m),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $d$ <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">同构类</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">对应到</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">相似类</span></strong>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">映射</span> $d$ <span lang=\"zh\">有两种具体写出的方法</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">通过</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Čech上同调","text":"Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $H^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mathrm{PGL}_n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个元素由覆盖</span> $U$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的上圈</span> $\\alpha\\colon U\\times_X U\\to \\mathrm{PGL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">通过细化覆盖</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即取覆盖</span> $U'\\to U$), <span lang=\"zh\">不妨设</span> $\\alpha$ <span lang=\"zh\">可提升至</span> $\\alpha\\colon U\\times_X U \\to \\mathrm{GL}_n$, <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $d$ <span lang=\"zh\">将这个上圈映射到</span> $\\mathbb G_m$-<span lang=\"zh\">系数的</span> $2$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span> Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上圈</span>$$\r\na = \\alpha\\mathrm{pr}_{23}\\cdot (\\alpha\\mathrm{pr}_{13})^{-1} \\cdot \\alpha\\mathrm{pr}_{12} \\colon U\\times_X U \\times_X U \\to \\mathbb G_m\\subset\\mathrm{GL}_n.\r\n$$</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">通过</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Azumaya代数","text":"Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/束","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>"}},{"Plain":" (gerbe) $F_A$.<span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $U\\in X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}}$, $F_A(U)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">同构</span> $A_U \\simeq \\operatorname{End}(E)$ ($E$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $U$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的向量丛</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">构成的</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">群胚</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">由于</span> Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平展景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部同构于矩阵代数</span>, $F_A$ <span lang=\"zh\">局部非空</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">构成一个由群</span> $\\mathbb G_m$ <span lang=\"zh\">控制的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/束","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>"}},{"Plain":":$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n  \\operatorname{Aut}_{F_A(U)}(x)&amp;\\simeq \\operatorname{Aut}_{\\operatorname{Aut}(\\operatorname{End}(E))}(\\mathrm{id})\\\\\r\n  &amp;\\simeq Z(\\operatorname{End}(E))\\simeq \\mathbb G_m(U),\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$(<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $Z$ <span lang=\"zh\">表示代数的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/中心","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">中心</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">从而</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/束","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的关系</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">定义了</span> $H^2(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mathbb G_m)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">并且它平凡当且仅当</span> $F_A$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/整体截面","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">整体</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">元素</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">在整体上同构于一个向量丛的自同态代数</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">挠</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">下图中每行每列均为群的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群短正合列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">短正合列</span>"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n{ccccc}\r\n\\mu_n &amp; \\to &amp; \\mathbb G_m &amp; \\to &amp; \\mathbb G_m\\\\\r\n\\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow &amp; &amp; |\\!| \\\\\r\n\\mathrm{SL}_n &amp; \\to &amp; \\mathrm{GL}_n &amp; \\to &amp; \\mathbb G_m\\\\\r\n\\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\\\\r\n\\mathrm{PGL}_n &amp; = &amp; \\mathrm{PGL}_n\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">比较第一列与第二列的上同调长正合列</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可得</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n{ccc}\r\nH^1(X,\\mathrm{PGL}_n) &amp; \\overset{\\mathrm{id}}{\\to} &amp; H^1(X,\\mathrm{PGL}_n)\\\\\r\n\\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\nH^2(X,\\mu_n) &amp; \\to &amp; H^2(X,\\mathbb G_m).\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">而</span> $H^2(X,\\mu_n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">挠群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">故同态</span> $H^1(X,\\mathrm{PGL}_n) \\to H^2(X,\\mathbb G_m)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的像是</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">挠群</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}